  "reasoning": "The defendant was a public health administrative officer who intentionally failed to transfer criminal cases of illegal medical practice to the judicial authorities, instead opting for administrative penalties to meet economic targets and personal benefit. This deliberate abuse of official authority for personal or unit gain constitutes the crime of '徇私舞弊罪' under Chinese criminal law. No other distinct offenses are supported by the facts.",
